WEBVTT

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:09.950
<v Caller>When one of your vans needs bodywork, do you choose the shop locally, or does head office handle that?

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.920
<v Fleet manager>We decide here, but we already have a shop.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.540
<v Caller>When they’re booked up, can you use a second shop?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.350
<v Fleet manager>Yes, if ours can’t give us an estimate date.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.320
<v Caller>Which vehicles would you send out in that situation?

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.150
<v Fleet manager>Mainly service vans. A few are high-roof.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.660
<v Caller>Does purchasing have to add us before you can request an estimate?

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:39.170
<v Fleet manager>I can ask for a quote. Purchasing approves the shop before we send a van.
